        { from: "bot", to: "chat", in: "after" },
      ]}
    />
  </StoryChapter>

  <StoryChapter id="lessons" title="What I learned">
    <div class="story-prose">
      <p>Counting is a feature. The recap only says anything because the site tracked saves, map opens and outbound clicks, and labelled them honestly as actions rather than people.</p>
      <p>And the hard part of a night-out app isn't the search box. It's everything after: the link opened later, the listing that changed, the signal that drops halfway down the street.</p>
    </div>
  </StoryChapter>
</StoryLayout>
